cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, together with the companion manuscript."
type: dataset
title: "CowTail-4: A Tail-Mounted Nine-Axis IMU Behaviour Dataset for Dairy Cattle"
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail"
url: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail"
abstract: >-
  A fully labelled field dataset of dairy-cattle behaviour recorded at the tail
  root with a nine-axis inertial sensor. It provides raw sensor streams, the
  annotation layer used to derive reference labels, and the model-input windows
  used in the companion manuscript: 4 cows, 31 sessions, 12,736 non-overlapping
  windows of 5.12 s at 50 Hz, and four behaviour classes (standing, lying,
  walking, feeding).
keywords:
  - cattle
  - dairy cattle
  - inertial measurement unit
  - accelerometer
  - animal behaviour
  - behaviour recognition
  - precision livestock farming
  - dataset
